<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>body{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:12px}h2{margin:0 0 10px}p{margin:0 0 8px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{border:1px solid #9aa3ad;padding:6px 8px;text-align:left}th{background:#dbeff0}</style></head><body><h2>Exposición potencial de ingresos DDE por legalizaciones</h2><p>Escenario central: distribución territorial usando beneficiarios 2024 y recursos específicos 2025; el monto expuesto no equivale automáticamente a pérdida real de recursos propios.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Departamento</th><th>Diplomas 2024</th><th>Diplomas estimados 2026</th><th>Otros recursos específicos 2025 (MM Bs)</th><th>Exposición máxima estimada (MM Bs)</th><th>Exposición sobre recursos específicos</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>La Paz</td><td>49.396</td><td>53.839</td><td>5.917</td><td>1000999.9999999999</td><td>16.9%</td></tr><tr><td>Santa Cruz</td><td>46.959</td><td>51.183</td><td>16.743</td><td>952000</td><td>5.7%</td></tr><tr><td>Cochabamba</td><td>36.562</td><td>39.85</td><td>10.353</td><td>741000</td><td>7.2%</td></tr><tr><td>Potosí</td><td>12.603</td><td>13.737</td><td>0.98</td><td>255000</td><td>26.1%</td></tr><tr><td>Chuquisaca</td><td>9.586</td><td>10.448</td><td>1.463</td><td>194000</td><td>13.3%</td></tr><tr><td>Oruro</td><td>9.471</td><td>10.323</td><td>1.389</td><td>192000</td><td>13.8%</td></tr><tr><td>Tarija</td><td>8.704</td><td>9.487</td><td>0.949</td><td>176000</td><td>18.6%</td></tr><tr><td>Beni</td><td>8.234</td><td>8.975</td><td>1.269</td><td>167000</td><td>13.1%</td></tr><tr><td>Pando</td><td>1.981</td><td>2.159</td><td>1.259</td><td>40000</td><td>3.2%</td></tr></tbody></table></body></html>